  "as_of": "2022-10-26",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would increase disability compensation for severely incapacitated veterans, including linked payments under the veterans’ entitlements and military rehabilitation and compensation systems.",
   "It would set the special rate payment at $1,595.66 a fortnight, an increase of $38.46 a fortnight for eligible veterans receiving the indexed rate.",
   "The changes would apply from 1 January 2023, including backdating the higher amounts if royal assent caused the legislation to commence after that date."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The statutory special rate would be replaced with the higher fortnightly amount.",
   "The Temporary Special Rate payment would rise through its legislative link to the special rate.",
   "The Special Rate Disability Pension under military compensation legislation would also increase."
  ],
  "affected": "Veterans receiving the affected disability payments, future eligible veterans and their families would be affected.",
